# Keep files short

- Prefer **~200–300 lines** per file; treat **~400+** as a signal to split.
- Split by **responsibility** (hooks / UI / utils / API), not by arbitrary line cuts.
- New features: create focused modules first; do not append into already-large files.
- Pages that orchestrate many concerns should be thin assemblers (`index` / `workspace`) that import smaller pieces.

```text
❌ one 1000-line studio.tsx with graph + save + toolbar + dialogs
✅ studio/{index,workspace,toolbar,canvas,dialogs,use-*-graph,use-*-lifecycle,graph-utils}
```
